<section class="story">
  <div class="section-label">{{ section.settings.section_label }}</div>
  <div class="story-inner">
    <div class="founder-photo">
      {% if section.settings.founder_photo != blank %}
        <img src="{{ section.settings.founder_photo | image_url: width: 400 }}" alt="Founder Photo">
      {% else %}
        <p>{{ section.settings.founder_photo_placeholder }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="story-content">
      <h2 class="section-title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
      <blockquote>{{ section.settings.quote }}</blockquote>
      <p>{{ section.settings.paragraph_1 }}</p>
      <p>{{ section.settings.paragraph_2 }}</p>
      <p>{{ section.settings.paragraph_3 }}</p>
      <p>{{ section.settings.paragraph_4 }}</p>
      <p class="founder-name">{{ section.settings.founder_name }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Founder Story",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section_label",
      "label": "Section Label",
      "default": "The Story Behind VedaBox"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "I Watched My Grandmother Suffer — And I Refused to Accept That Was the Only Way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "quote",
      "label": "Pull Quote",
      "default": "Her sugar was 'controlled' — but the medicines were quietly destroying everything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_1",
      "label": "Paragraph 1",
      "default": "My grandmother was diagnosed with Type 2 diabetes when I was twelve. For the next fifteen years, I watched her faithfully take her medications — and I watched those medications slowly take their toll. Her kidneys weakened. Her appetite disappeared. She spent more time managing side effects than living her life."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_2",
      "label": "Paragraph 2",
      "default": "When I started my PhD in Ayurvedic pharmacology, I began to understand what she had been going through. The modern pharmaceutical approach to blood sugar management focuses on suppressing symptoms — not supporting the body's ability to regulate itself. I knew there had to be a better way."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_3",
      "label": "Paragraph 3",
      "default": "I spent three years reviewing clinical studies on Ayurvedic herbs with documented effects on blood glucose, insulin sensitivity, and metabolic health. I formulated, tested, and refined until I had something I was genuinely proud of. VedaBox Diabetic Care is the result — a formula I wish my grandmother could have had."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_4",
      "label": "Paragraph 4",
      "default": "I'm not asking you to abandon your doctor's advice. I'm asking you to consider that your body has extraordinary capacity to heal and regulate itself — and that the right herbs, at the right doses, can support that process. That's what VedaBox is built to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "founder_name",
      "label": "Founder Signature",
      "default": "— Founder, VedaBox · vedabox.in"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "founder_photo",
      "label": "Founder Photo"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "founder_photo_placeholder",
      "label": "Placeholder Text (if no photo)",
      "default": "Add Founder\nPhoto Here"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Founder Story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
